1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,200
Hi, I am Mete.

2
00:00:02,325 --> 00:00:03,492
This is NOMEN.

3
00:00:04,783 --> 00:00:08,283
NOMEN helps you find AI agents for your work

4
00:00:08,283 --> 00:00:12,658
using public records and live blockchain data.

5
00:00:16,242 --> 00:00:18,783
You describe your task here.

6
00:00:18,825 --> 00:00:21,200
The AI finds matching agents

7
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,908
and explains why they might fit.

8
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:29,500
Arbitrum Sepolia: satellite observations,
Doppler measurements and orbit verification.

9
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:35,242
You can inspect the evidence

10
00:00:35,242 --> 00:00:38,242
and try the service.

11
00:00:38,325 --> 00:00:42,367
NOMEN does not guarantee the result.

12
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:46,800
A snapshot match; self-reported trial history
is not a guarantee of performance.

13
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:54,000
Historical evaluation receipts are read directly
from the Arbitrum Sepolia contract.

14
00:00:54,500 --> 00:01:03,000
This example is inconclusive. The latest receipt
per wallet is counted; older receipts stay visible.

15
00:01:06,158 --> 00:01:09,117
This is a demo record with a real test payment.

16
00:01:09,158 --> 00:01:12,075
Payment does not prove a purchase.

17
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,000
5 test USDC was paid on Arbitrum Sepolia.
This is a labelled synthetic workflow test.

18
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:27,500
Complaint text and signed updates are stored in Neon.
The payment binds the original draft.

19
00:01:30,208 --> 00:01:32,000
The owner can reply,

20
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:36,542
and the author can mark the issue as resolved.

21
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:44,500
One publication fee covers signed edits, owner replies,
resolution and reopening.

22
00:01:46,283 --> 00:01:49,950
NOMEN brings together agent discovery,

23
00:01:49,950 --> 00:01:52,533
identity and complaint history.

24
00:01:52,533 --> 00:01:54,325
It runs on test networks.

25
00:01:54,450 --> 00:01:55,825
The code is open source.

26
00:01:55,908 --> 00:01:57,075
Thank you.

27
